":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Naturally, it's good for you!\r\nBursting with all sorts of sunshine-y citrus deliciousness, it's no wonder we call it \"Super.\" With each sip, you can feel the essential nutrients flow through your body in a wave of Emergen-C rejuvenation. If feeling good is your thing, you found the right box."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Get your free samples at emergenc.com!\r\nWhile supplies last. See website for limitations.\r\nFeel the good"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Fix it how you like it!\r\nLess water = More flavor"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: Ages 14 and up, one (1) packet daily. Empty contents into a glass, add 4-6 oz of water, stir. For lighter flavor, mix with more water."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not exceed suggested use."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"If you are pregnant, nursing, or taking medication, consult your doctor before use."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Caffeine-free\r\nGluten-free\r\n"},{"type":"Formulation re: Vegetarian/Vegan","notes":"Vegetarian"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Natural sweeteners & flavors"},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Immune support\r\n1000 mg of vitamin C plus other antioxidants zinc and manganese support your immune system.\r\nEnergy\r\n7 B vitamins including B1, B2, B3, B5, B6, B9 and B12 without caffeine.\r\nElectrolytes\r\nGreat for post work-out, replace key electrolytes lost through perspiration."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Copyri